{"data":{"body":"With multiple exporters, callbacks run on executor workers while the pump joins those workers. If a callback re-enters `flush()` or `drain()`, this check returns false: the worker waits for the current pump while the pump waits for that worker, permanently hanging the invocation. Mark fan-out callback threads as pump-dependent (for example, using a `ThreadLocal` around `action.accept`) and refuse waits from them too; add a two-exporter regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7wUseo","finding_digest":"929f1dbdd474106743bc9c976952064188f62132077955695f0ee121ba4a06b5","finding_id":"arf_v1_skpr3pouoqigoq54tslwsuqgig","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exportscheduler::refusewaitfromthepumpthread::fanout-worker-deadlock","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exportscheduler::refusewaitfromthepumpthread::fanout-worker-deadlock","line":692,"observation_digest":"78dccd65533fa1781b304be959698b088311a8e955205e27a5e0b7c22cce3371","observation_id":"aro_v1_pdom2zkth6qxqgzqjpuvs2mlbc","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/ExportScheduler.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-17T00:21:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_pojlg7dt7h4ejzhnkw7semfabs","reviewed_base_sha":"0f8556febf2ae5af51a61c56b77da040bd9c70aa","reviewed_head_sha":"adb57764dd7b0d927e52f756ecb9bca4eb0f5a91","reviewer":"codex","start_line":690,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":720},"record_id":"art_v1_3tqhs4mzblks7pujxcmiqrs43z","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T00:21:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
